\ul{
\li{\strong{The guard holds.} The geometric mean of the eight warm passes goes from 1.839 to 1.714 s, -6.8 \%, and every corpus is faster, by 4.4 \% (navier-stokes-euler) to 8.7 \% (cslib); Mathlib 13.14 to 12.29 s. The CPU of a pass goes down with it, 0.929 in the geometric mean.}
\li{\strong{Memory.} The peak resident set falls where the smaller probe budget cuts a probe that had filled a session: con-leche 1,347 to 927 MiB, cslib 2,003 to 1,624, Mathlib 4,420 to 4,062. Elsewhere it is within 10 MiB.}
