\p{Nothing a window resolves: Std and cslib 0.999, Mathlib 1.002 by the passes, 0.994 to 0.998 by the CPU, the same peak memory. The rule that an entry of the instantiation caches survives a reset only by content is paid at a reset, not in a probe. The two executables are two builds of an image; the window had no compaction stall (the counter did not move) and 8,700 to 8,780 free blocks of 2 MiB.}
}

